module gunbc.live_deploy.release_pair_deliver_cli
// THE EXECUTING CONSUMER of the staged wet plan (PR-2a). This module turns the lab's release pair into a real,
// observed delivery: release_pair_deliver_run OBSERVES origin/main's head (what to deploy), DISCOVERS the release-bins
// run for that exact head, FETCHES its pack, OBSERVES the fetched serve member's digest and the consumer build-key
// verdict ON the fetched pack, and only then feeds those OBSERVED results through release_pair_install_plan ->
// deliver_release_pair. No stage takes a predecessor's result as an input it did not observe. Discovery and command
// minting stay gh-only through extdeps.tools.gh's admitted builders (git is not in the sealed program census); the
// digest is admitted through extdeps.crypto.hash::sha256sum_line_digest.
//
// RUNG: the decode fns are total pure functions over ProcessOutcome and are witnessed green by execution
// (release_pair_deliver_cli_witness); the effectful entry release_pair_deliver_run composes those legs through the
// admissible command seam and is executed by the pair-delivery unit's own run — its consumer/trigger frontier is the
// PR3b unit registered under roadmap item `lab-converges-release-pair`. It typechecks in the same claim closure as
// the witnessed decode fns; its wet behaviour is proven at the paired deploy, not by a hand step.

